{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495355,"name":"","username":"oxi_ixo","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/o/9de053/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T17:27:37.969Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll bots accept messages but never reply. Same from the Grok Bot desktop app, mobile, and Grok chat wakes. Turns finish empty. Computer view still works.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollowed Ctrl+Q → Settings → Updates → Reset Grok Bot’s Computer → test message. App is up to date. Reset finished. Test message still no reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHas not been working since the morning of 9/17, except one message that went through around 11:00 AM that day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend “test” or “hello” to an existing bot from Grok Bot \u0026amp; Grok.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMessage is accepted.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo reply. Turn ends with no text.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSame after full quit, after Reset Grok Bot’s Computer, and on mobile.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot replies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot:\u003cbr\u003e\nVersion: 0.56.1\u003cbr\u003e\nStable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I already tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFull quit (Ctrl+Q) and reopen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNew test chat / short ping\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMobile: same failure\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsked Grok to ping: same failure\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIs it possibly reply runner?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495355-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495355-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T18:32:04.711Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":13,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":61.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172290,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-reset-completed-all-bots-still-silent","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138672,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-reset-completed-all-bots-still-silent/172290/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":495372,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T18:31:41.846Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Good news: your Grok Bot computer and the bots themselves are fine. The reset completed normally, your data is saved, and there’s nothing for us to restore on our side. You also don’t need to run Reset again for this situation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat actually happened: your account hit the weekly included Grok Bot usage limit on September 17 at around 11:37 AM Arizona time. After that, every message (desktop, mobile, and Grok wakes) is accepted but rejected before the bot can reply. The app should show a notice about this instead of staying silent. That missing notice is a known issue we’re tracking. Sorry for the confusion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can check your remaining usage and the reset time in the app at Settings → Usage. Your weekly usage should reset around Sunday, September 20 (you’ll see the exact time there). After the reset, the bots should start replying again. One note: bots messaging each other and scheduled routines also use the same weekly pool.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you need the bots before Sunday, you can enable On-Demand usage at \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard/spending\u003c/a\u003e. Log in with the same Grok account you use in Grok Bot. It usually takes effect within a few minutes, and you don’t need a separate Cursor plan for it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if the bots are still silent after the reset or after you enable On-Demand.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T18:31:41.846Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":11.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172290,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-reset-completed-all-bots-still-silent","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-reset-completed-all-bots-still-silent/172290/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495391,"name":"","username":"oxi_ixo","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/o/9de053/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T19:07:27.321Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e(post deleted by author)\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T1